      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at booking a trip to Venezuela for some business meetings in Caracas late next month. I've seen some news about the recent election stuff and things looking a bit tense. Can you give me a brief overview of the current political situation there so I know what to expect, but keep it focused on how it might affect travel stability? Just want to know if it's safe to move around. thanks.",
